      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-296201",
      ":question/problem": "A coach recorded how many laps students completed during a training session. The incomplete data set is shown below.\n\n| Laps Completed | Frequency |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $1$ | $1$ |\n| $2$ | $2$ |\n| $3$ | $x$ |\n| $4$ | $7$ |\n| $5$ | $5$ |\n| $6$ | $8$ |\n\nIf $3$ is a mode of the data set, which of the following values could be the value of $x$?\n\n1. $8$\n2. $9$\n3. $7$"
