      ":question/problem": "A teacher recorded the number of puzzles solved by students during a school competition. The incomplete data set is shown below.\n\n| Puzzles Solved | Frequency |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $1$ | $3$ |\n| $2$ | $4$ |\n| $3$ | $x$ |\n| $4$ | $6$ |\n| $5$ | $5$ |\n| $6$ | $7$ |\n\nIf $3$ is a mode of the data set, which of the following values could be the value of $x$?\n\n1. $6$\n2. $8$\n3. $7$"
